`s 344(a)(1) — the reading this row takes of the period of the figures` MEANS `the period of the figures is declined`

@ref National Insurance Law s 344(a)(1) (source line 3686)
GIVEN B IS A NUMBER
      f IS A `The figures for the monthly income of a member of a cooperative kibbutz`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 344(a)(1) — the monthly income of a member of a cooperative kibbutz, the basic amount under paragraph (3) being` B `, the figures` f MEANS
    `s 344(a)(1) — the monthly income of a member of a cooperative kibbutz, the basic amount under paragraph (3) being` B `, reading the period of the figures as` (`s 344(a)(1) — the reading this row takes of the period of the figures`) `, the figures` f

